'''Behind Closed Doors''' (アフター５, ''Afutā 5'', '''After 5''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

==Effect==
Cat Cannon Power UP (Sm): Cat Cannon attack power increases by 20%.

